# Development (pnpm dev / vite) - salin jadi .env.development.
# Same-origin lewat Vite proxy (vite.config.ts: /api -> sambasku-staging).
# JANGAN ubah ke absolute URL lintas situs - cookie refresh_token
# sameSite=Strict tidak terkirim kalau origin beda situs, dan reload akan
# "amnesia" (kembali ke halaman login).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
VITE_APP_NAME=Kamus Sambas - Admin Console (Dev)

# Override proxy target (default: sambasku-staging.iamutaki.com):
# VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:3000
